{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1001_p", "source_sha256": "00f8f4f6f28eab6700637da77f8ed83844fb748ecf1e6648fa86b564ef3bdc5a", "ja": "おおっ、よく似合ってるじゃないか。\n思った通り、やよいにピッタリだな！", "zh": "哦哦，很适合你喔。\n果然如我所料，很适合弥生呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "08d594266fa9a1e2be0ab3c2ad8523b2b98994efa1e077129a1d1bca4657e99d", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございますっ。\nそれにこの衣装、とっても動きやすくて。", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你。\n而且这件服装很方便活动喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
