{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1c556e18cd869e5966c9bd9fe9931e722c13185ec3b4a547653d7e0b0a444593", "ja": "おお、すごいじゃないか。その様子なら、今度の\nスポーツイベントの仕事も問題なくこなせそうだな！", "zh": "哦哦，真是厉害啊。照这样看来，\n感觉能顺利完成这次的运动赛事工作呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "756fbdc4e94cc7c694ce106e872e49791430d648b51f54556edada8e323a6b59", "ja": "スポーツイベントのお仕事……それって、\nこの衣装で運動したりするってことですか？", "zh": "运动赛事的工作……\n意思是要穿着这件服装运动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0da3b9fefb6bf5b9d8514af7aa6f64b7eb516ef6480f8d172da4e92373cae322", "ja": "ああ。実際にスポーツをこなしても\n大丈夫なように作られてるからな。", "zh": "是啊，那件服装有经过设计，\n就算要实际穿着运动也不成问题喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "ab518c4f1d16a0f81c12e79cc60606bb48b6b3c9ff5b7b6b83b0703a778a4a70", "ja": "そうですか……。うーん……。", "zh": "这样啊……嗯～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1008_p", "source_sha256": "59bd7c70381b05446dc1265063526154318670418ccec6f72a8b89c189f107a8", "ja": "あ、あれ？\nなにか気になることがあるのか？", "zh": "咦，怎么了？\n难道你有什么在意的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "40af4b48f8a5a6d6c4bc12ccd5a7804d17daa82384c57599eafe04957c4e7341", "ja": "えっと……弟達のことなんですけど、外で運動をして\n帰ってくると、いつも服がドロドロになっちゃって。", "zh": "呃……我的弟弟们只要在外面运动回来，\n身上的衣服总是会沾满泥巴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "cbd4e13c1a89eb9d58d589fbba5ccf2ed681df396955e72cddd10535b997df0a", "ja": "それだけみんな元気ってことだからいいんですけど、\n泥汚れって、なかなか落ちないんですー。", "zh": "不过那也代表大家很有精神，所以我是觉得无妨，\n但是泥巴污渍实在很难洗掉呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "91289a4f5915ebdc61ef3ed0caac3e550befa936f795cad8f7919f713b097174", "ja": "この衣装も、せっかくこんなにかわいいのに、\n汚しちゃったらどうしようって……。", "zh": "这件服装也是，人家特地准备了这么可爱的服装，\n我担心要是弄脏了该怎么办……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d8e808da8b0e5b524edd4baba75cc85f97a9cd078a7760afec17ff60bca177cb", "ja": "なるほど……。\nやよいはそれが心配だったんだな。", "zh": "这样子啊……\n原来弥生在担心的是这个呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "6e9c1ecd9ce9a24058309358722afd60cacb3b39b379315d3c49d38921b9625d", "ja": "このままだと、全力で運動できないかもです……。\n{$P$}、どうしたらいいですか？", "zh": "这样下去的话，我可能没办法尽情去运动……\n{$P$}，这该怎么办才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6fb74b2b8b3add0b69fc1ed004d495f1b12386ceaed3d26677fd275f9795b521", "ja": "それなら大丈夫。劇場には、どんなに衣装が汚れても、\nピカピカにしてくれるプロがいるからな！", "zh": "这点你不用担心，因为在剧场里有不论服装变得多脏，\n都能洗得干干净净的专家在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "88c3c19363fb731fd46e30d5df02fa6f7284541d52a7325c2295a2ed318c8780", "ja": "ええっ！？\n本当ですか、{$P$}！？", "zh": "咦咦！？\n真的吗，{$P$}！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2c809a0bec28aa3000d21c5da846e8a216af31acffc1785245242b6a53177463", "ja": "ああ。やよいの衣装も、いつもキレイだろ？\nだから、安心して仕事を……。", "zh": "是啊，弥生的服装不也总是很干净吗？\n所以你就放心去工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "1d4c51410046f6205bdd820c6e7c5e3d7c1249c15c5eb8feffdf7f1d9f6645ae", "ja": "キレイに泥を落とせるなんて、すごいです！\nどうすればいいんですか！？", "zh": "竟然能把泥巴污渍洗得干净溜溜，太厉害了！\n究竟该怎么洗才行呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1018_p", "source_sha256": "92954bb455f88e1e4ed86cedbeb94ccc01053ffd49cf13dd5f6038ae8840d32f", "ja": "えっ……あ、ああ、あとで教えてもらおう。だから、\nやよいは全力で、スポーツイベントに挑んでほしい！", "zh": "咦……呃、呃呃，之后再请那一位教你吧。\n所以弥生要尽全力去挑战运动赛事喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "ab931c1d8b3fe546d5161277f06fc48acc3830ff67c81e2d660387258d01bbe4", "ja": "はい、わかりました！　あとで教えてもらえたら、\n長介のジャージも浩太郎のシャツもピカピカに……！", "zh": "好的，我知道了！等到我学会怎么洗之后，\n长介的运动服和浩太郎的衬衫就能变得干干净净了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0124_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "7fdb710a7b53a4054168b23bce67c699c0d1b332a416840f5a8adc721dba2a75", "ja": "えへへっ、私もいーっぱい運動して、泥だらけになって\nみますね！　スポーツイベント、頑張りまーす！", "zh": "嘿嘿，我也会很～努力去运动，让全身都沾满泥巴的！\n这次的运动赛事，我会加油的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
